WEBVTT

00:01.870 --> 00:06.580
<i>There once was a powerless prince who 
saved a kingdom with his tiny courage.</i>

00:07.660 --> 00:10.090
<i>The courage to face challenges...</i>

00:10.090 --> 00:12.100
<i>The courage to never give up...</i>

00:12.470 --> 00:14.650
<i>The courage to trust others...</i>

00:15.420 --> 00:20.110
<i>A treasure chest of untold courage 
is now about to be opened.</i>

00:27.130 --> 00:33.550
<b>Ranking of Kings</b>

00:27.130 --> 00:33.550
<b>— The Treasure Chest of Courage —</b>

01:52.640 --> 01:55.050
<i>After Bojji had mastered Despa's 
arts and finished his training,</i>

01:55.050 --> 01:56.710
<i>he rushed back to his motherland,</i>

01:57.430 --> 02:01.010
<i>along with Kage and the 
Order of the Underworld,</i>

02:01.010 --> 02:06.090
<i>to deal with the plot that was swirling 
around the Kingdom of Bosse.</i>

02:08.170 --> 02:10.460
Captain! At the pace we've been keeping,

02:10.460 --> 02:12.310
we should reach the Kingdom 
of Bosse in no time, right?

02:12.780 --> 02:14.720
No, we aren't even halfway there yet.

02:15.060 --> 02:17.940
Oh, really? It takes quite a while, huh?

02:23.160 --> 02:27.410
<b>Beasts of the Wilderness</b>

02:35.260 --> 02:38.100
Hey, Bojji! Hey!

02:41.200 --> 02:43.420
What do you think? 
Pretty strong-looking, right?

02:45.030 --> 02:46.920
I'm a cactus. See?

02:53.880 --> 02:55.820
Captain, we brought some more.

02:57.090 --> 02:58.790
Oh, thanks.

02:58.790 --> 03:01.200
And Prince Bojji, thank you very much, too.

03:02.300 --> 03:03.210
Hmm?

03:06.280 --> 03:08.710
What are those men doing?

03:08.710 --> 03:12.680
Keeping a lookout. Apparently, 
there are wild beasts around here.

03:12.680 --> 03:14.250
We have to be cautious.

03:14.480 --> 03:15.670
Wild beasts?

03:15.670 --> 03:19.210
Yeah. Word is that they show 
up at night and eat people.

03:20.360 --> 03:23.910
H-Hmph! Wild beasts are no match for Bojji

03:23.910 --> 03:26.130
now that he's so powerful 
after Despa's training.

03:26.130 --> 03:27.700
Right, Bojji?

03:35.760 --> 03:37.960
I think I'll get some sleep now, too.

03:37.960 --> 03:41.080
But before I do, a quick bathroom break.

03:43.400 --> 03:46.770
Whoo, I'll sleep soundly until morning now.

04:05.170 --> 04:07.630
I-It can't be!

04:08.580 --> 04:11.160
Bojji! Bojji!

04:12.090 --> 04:14.820
Th-There's a wild beast! 
A wild beast turned up!

04:14.820 --> 04:17.140
There's a wild beast over there!

04:28.630 --> 04:30.640
Hmm? There's somebody over there.

04:31.360 --> 04:33.650
They aren't Order of the Underworld, either.

04:35.770 --> 04:37.300
That's a wild beast growling!

04:39.830 --> 04:42.120
You think they're gonna get attacked?

04:43.530 --> 04:45.400
All right, let's go.

04:54.690 --> 04:56.570
No, I thought they went <i>this</i> way.

04:57.670 --> 05:01.950
Damn, we lost sight of them. 
I hope they'll be okay—

05:04.790 --> 05:08.960
Ah! Ugh, now I wish I'd borrowed a cloak.

05:10.880 --> 05:11.240
Hmm?

05:12.920 --> 05:13.970
It's a house!

05:21.710 --> 05:24.440
Hey! Is anybody home?

05:25.310 --> 05:27.890
They've got their lights on.
 Isn't anybody there?

05:35.570 --> 05:37.410
You don't suppose wild 
beasts did this, do you?

05:40.610 --> 05:42.810
Hey, is anybody here?

05:48.120 --> 05:49.590
What a mess.

05:49.900 --> 05:52.620
They must have been attacked 
by wild beasts, all right.

05:54.190 --> 05:57.160
What's this? That's one huge sword.

06:03.660 --> 06:05.120
Hey, are you okay?!

06:05.570 --> 06:08.590
Sorry. If only we'd gotten here sooner...

06:11.060 --> 06:13.500
Who are you two?

06:13.500 --> 06:16.870
Huh? Oh, I'm Kage. This is Bojji.

06:17.850 --> 06:21.820
Don't worry. Now that we're here, 
everything's gonna be fine.

06:21.820 --> 06:25.990
Bojji is insanely strong, you see. 
Those wild beasts don't stand a chance.

06:25.990 --> 06:27.810
W-Wild beasts?

06:31.100 --> 06:33.030
Ah, there it is.

06:34.030 --> 06:36.510
I'd be out of business without this.

06:38.520 --> 06:42.460
Ah! Any chance you guys are the 
ones who were prowling around outside?

06:42.760 --> 06:44.570
Who are you guys?

06:45.250 --> 06:48.660
That makes sense. So they got 
attacked by the wild beasts

06:48.660 --> 06:50.850
while you guys had stepped out.

06:51.580 --> 06:55.130
Well, luckily, it doesn't 
look like anyone got hurt.

06:55.130 --> 06:56.090
Huh?!

06:56.090 --> 06:59.950
I gotta say, though, that's awesome! 
You drove them off with that, right?

06:59.950 --> 07:04.340
Uh, drove them off? Yeah, 
when I show people this sword,

07:04.340 --> 07:06.470
everybody tucks tail and runs away.

07:06.800 --> 07:08.820
Ooh, that's so cool!

07:10.460 --> 07:12.940
He says it sure is a relief 
having you around.

07:14.720 --> 07:18.240
There aren't too many people who can 
stand up to the boss, after all.

07:18.240 --> 07:22.850
I'm curious, though. What are you kids 
doing out here so late at night?

07:23.830 --> 07:26.500
What kind of fake crown is this?

07:28.060 --> 07:31.920
It's not fake! Someday, Bojji is
 gonna be a real-life king!

07:31.920 --> 07:33.290
A king?

07:33.780 --> 07:37.270
Hmm, those are some mighty fine 
clothes you're wearing, huh?

07:37.980 --> 07:39.600
H-Hey! Cut that out!

07:39.830 --> 07:40.930
What was that?

07:40.930 --> 07:42.350
Shut up and hand them over—

07:44.410 --> 07:45.650
What are you doing?!

07:45.650 --> 07:47.840
What are we doing, you ask?

07:47.840 --> 07:50.100
This is our job, see?

07:50.420 --> 07:52.990
Your job? You guys are...

07:53.360 --> 07:54.950
Th-They're robbers!

07:54.950 --> 07:56.450
Robbers?!

07:56.840 --> 07:59.400
That's right. Can't you 
tell by looking at us?

08:00.430 --> 08:02.760
Are you the ones who messed up this house?!

08:02.760 --> 08:04.800
You got a problem with that?!

08:07.140 --> 08:08.950
You didn't wet yourselves, did you?!

08:11.660 --> 08:12.750
Huh?

08:13.040 --> 08:13.710
Bojji!

08:16.930 --> 08:19.790
Hey, now, what do you think you're gonna do

08:19.790 --> 08:21.520
with a needle-shaped sword like that?

08:21.520 --> 08:22.340
Get him, guys!

08:22.340 --> 08:23.400
Yeah!

08:23.400 --> 08:24.760
Take this!

08:36.540 --> 08:39.110
Yes! That's my Bojji!

08:41.590 --> 08:43.440
We give up!

08:43.440 --> 08:46.710
Just spare our lives! You can 
have all the money you want!

08:47.490 --> 08:48.970
Hey, don't move!

08:53.310 --> 08:55.240
That was dirty!

08:56.570 --> 08:59.620
Ha! To a robber, that's a compliment.

08:59.620 --> 09:02.010
That kid uses a strange technique.

09:02.010 --> 09:03.300
Hand over your weapon!

09:07.580 --> 09:08.530
Gotcha!

09:09.610 --> 09:10.640
Damn it!

09:12.060 --> 09:14.110
I'll wipe out the whole lot of you!

09:14.600 --> 09:15.580
Now!

09:19.950 --> 09:20.790
Bojji!

09:39.340 --> 09:41.900
Whoo! Nicely done!

09:43.220 --> 09:44.720
Hey! Hold up!

09:55.080 --> 09:56.570
Wh-What is that?!

10:02.030 --> 10:04.920
W-Wild beast!

10:05.320 --> 10:06.670
Wild beast?

10:06.670 --> 10:08.920
I-It's just me!

10:12.240 --> 10:13.450
Captain?

10:26.230 --> 10:30.890
So I saw Prince Bojji and 
you leaving and went after you.

10:31.500 --> 10:33.970
I'd appreciate it if you 
didn't go off on your own.

10:33.970 --> 10:39.140
S-Sorry. I was trying to go to sleep, 
but I heard this "grr" sound.

10:39.140 --> 10:42.490
Hmm? That may have been the 
wild beasts we heard about.

10:42.490 --> 10:43.660
I'm glad you're all right.

10:54.290 --> 10:56.270
There he goes, sleepwalking again.

10:56.270 --> 10:59.050
That is some crazy snoring.

11:03.830 --> 11:06.370
I must say, that was quite a feat.

11:06.370 --> 11:09.470
You rounded up a whole 
band of wanted thieves.

11:09.810 --> 11:13.170
Heh-heh, Bojji is the 
ultimate guy, after all!

11:14.550 --> 11:18.030
Mm-hmm. Well, we need to be off.

11:18.030 --> 11:18.710
Yeah!

11:31.870 --> 11:31.960
<b>Ranking of Kings</b>

11:31.960 --> 11:32.040
<b>Ranking of Kings</b>

11:32.040 --> 11:32.170
<b>Ranking of Kings</b>

11:32.170 --> 11:36.840
<b>Ranking of Kings</b>

11:38.330 --> 11:43.950
<i>Bojji and Kage had unexpectedly 
rounded up a wanted band of thieves.</i>

11:44.530 --> 11:49.000
<i>The group continued to hurry on 
their way to the Kingdom of Bosse.</i>

11:52.030 --> 11:54.570
D-Don't let yourself get blown off, Bojji!

11:54.870 --> 11:58.010
Close ranks, men! Whatever happens,
 don't get separated!

11:58.310 --> 12:00.590
Captain, if this keeps up...

12:01.220 --> 12:02.780
Wh-Whoa-oa-oa!

12:06.760 --> 12:07.500
Bojji!

12:13.480 --> 12:16.520
Bojji!

12:18.880 --> 12:24.640
<b>A Mysterious Desert</b>

12:29.700 --> 12:30.800
Is everyone all right?

12:33.290 --> 12:36.510
Bojji! Bojji! Hey!

12:42.000 --> 12:44.200
It's no use. He's gone.

12:46.330 --> 12:48.130
Bojji? Bojji!

12:51.910 --> 12:53.360
Bojji!

12:57.340 --> 12:58.090
Huh?

13:05.530 --> 13:07.000
Awesome!

13:10.350 --> 13:11.670
Thank goodness.

13:12.050 --> 13:13.580
Let's take a break here.

13:13.580 --> 13:15.540
Bojji, we can drink this water.

13:24.110 --> 13:25.640
What's that?

13:44.120 --> 13:46.600
Hmm... I've never seen creatures 
like these before.

13:48.330 --> 13:50.310
Yeah, I remember seeing them, too.

13:50.880 --> 13:53.730
They look a lot like those strange 
creatures from that one time, huh?

13:59.870 --> 14:01.550
Please be careful!

14:04.060 --> 14:06.040
It might bite you!

14:06.040 --> 14:08.060
Bite him?!

14:17.220 --> 14:18.490
Please stop that!

14:20.650 --> 14:22.800
We know nothing about these creatures.

14:22.800 --> 14:24.580
If you take them lightly, 
you could get hurt.

14:24.580 --> 14:26.480
Yahoo!

14:30.250 --> 14:31.670
Captain!

14:36.580 --> 14:39.640
Ahem! They seem safe.

14:53.370 --> 14:56.680
That one seems a little different 
from the others somehow.

15:04.820 --> 15:08.050
Hmm? What is it? What's the matter?

15:25.640 --> 15:27.890
Wh-What is that thing?!

15:37.960 --> 15:39.120
It's coming this way!

15:45.940 --> 15:46.540
Bojji!

15:46.850 --> 15:47.680
Prince Bojji!

15:51.680 --> 15:53.350
Ready weapons!

16:16.300 --> 16:17.330
What the...

16:18.210 --> 16:19.120
Right!

16:21.330 --> 16:22.840
He says, "Let me handle this!"

16:23.240 --> 16:24.330
But...

16:26.710 --> 16:28.300
Go, Bojji!

16:29.930 --> 16:31.220
Oh yeah!

16:31.220 --> 16:32.220
Whoa!

16:37.880 --> 16:38.880
Huh?!

16:41.470 --> 16:43.210
You've never seen a creature 
like this before,

16:43.210 --> 16:45.080
so you don't know where its weak spot is?!

16:47.610 --> 16:50.580
Since they're similar creatures, 
what if they have the same weak spots?

16:50.910 --> 16:54.890
Bojji! Doesn't that look 
like a horse to you?

16:59.250 --> 17:01.510
S-So then...

17:02.410 --> 17:05.090
O-Or a bird! How about a bird?

17:10.870 --> 17:13.760
Let's see... Let's see...

17:14.070 --> 17:16.520
Wh-What about a snake? A snake!

17:26.850 --> 17:28.820
F-Fall back!

17:29.650 --> 17:30.920
Bojji!

17:31.380 --> 17:33.080
Hold it! It's too dangerous!

17:36.540 --> 17:38.440
Bojji, nice catch!

17:52.490 --> 17:53.430
What's the matter?

18:07.420 --> 18:08.110
Bojji!

18:10.490 --> 18:11.560
Prince Bojji!

18:11.990 --> 18:13.930
Bojji! Run!

18:43.540 --> 18:45.550
Bojji, are you okay?

18:46.390 --> 18:47.880
What exactly is going on?

18:49.540 --> 18:52.210
That little guy is the huge one's child?!

18:52.800 --> 18:55.990
So that's it. It thought its 
child was being taken away,

18:55.990 --> 18:57.870
and it was trying to get it back.

19:00.150 --> 19:02.690
So that's its mommy?

19:14.360 --> 19:18.330
Sorry for getting so rough with you 
when you weren't doing anything wrong!

19:33.510 --> 19:35.610
Wh-What is that?!

20:01.100 --> 20:03.140
Bojji!

20:19.060 --> 20:20.160
Bojji?

20:22.510 --> 20:23.790
Bojji!

20:24.890 --> 20:26.480
Hey!

20:35.330 --> 20:36.490
Bojji!

20:46.040 --> 20:47.730
The oasis has vanished.

20:47.730 --> 20:50.150
Was it all a mirage?

20:57.770 --> 21:01.730
Yeah, you're right. Let's hurry
 back to your kingdom.

21:02.720 --> 21:04.650
Yes, let's hurry.

21:04.650 --> 21:05.480
Yeah!
